  "helpIntro": "Quick answers about sessions, payments, and roles.",
  "aboutTitle": "ABOUT",
  "aboutAppHeading": "MonoLedger",
  "aboutAppBody": "MonoLedger turns board-game night into a seamless digital ledger. Host or join a session, track balances in real time, pay the bank or other players with a tactile slide-to-confirm flow, and review every move in a shared transaction history.",
  "aboutDeveloperHeading": "Developer",
  "aboutDeveloperBody": "MonoLedger was created by Louay Barraq — focused on clean, fast tooling for game nights with friends and family.",

  "faqQ1": "What is MonoLedger?",
  "faqA1": "MonoLedger is a digital cash manager for board-game nights. It replaces physical bills with live balances, a shared ledger, and slide-to-pay transfers.",
  "faqQ2": "How do I create a session?",
  "faqA2": "From the home screen, tap Create Session, set the starting capital and GO amount, enter your name, and share the 6-character code or QR code with friends.",
  "faqQ3": "How do I join a session?",
  "faqA3": "Tap Join Session, then enter the code or scan the host's QR code. Enter your display name and confirm.",
  "faqQ4": "What is the Banker?",
  "faqA4": "The Banker hosts the session. They can end the game, remove players, pass the Banker role on, approve GO salary requests, pay out from the bank and undo a mistaken payment.",
  "faqQ5": "How does GO salary work?",
  "faqA5": "When you pass GO, tap Collect Salary on the wallet tab. Other players send a request that the Banker approves or declines; the Banker collects instantly.",
  "faqQ6": "Can I leave and rejoin?",
  "faqA6": "Yes. If you leave, you can rejoin the same session with its code and you keep the balance you had when you left.",
  "faqQ7": "What happens if I am removed?",
  "faqA7": "You leave the player list and cannot rejoin that session. You'll see a notice and return to the home screen.",
  "faqQ8": "Can a payment be undone?",
  "faqA8": "Yes. The Banker can long-press any entry in the ledger to reverse it once. The reversal appears as its own entry so everyone can see it.",
  "faqQ9": "Is my data stored online?",
  "faqA9": "Sessions, balances and payments are stored online so every player sees them in real time. You can delete your data at any time in Settings.",
  "faqQ10": "Which games is it for?",
  "faqA10": "Any board game that uses play money. The defaults (1,500 to start, 200 for passing GO) suit classic property-trading games.",

